 "notes": [
  "Strong's H5774 folds two senses into one lemma: \"fly\" and (\"by implication of dimness\") \"grow faint/weary\" -- BDB treats the latter as a separate homonymous root (עוף/עיף). Since only one Strong's number exists for both, the Qal wayyiqtol category was excluded here: all four attested wayyiqtol/3ms forms (1Sam.14.28, 1Sam.14.31, 2Sam.21.15, Judg.4.21) are the \"faint/weary\" sense, not \"fly\", and no wayyiqtol attestation of \"fly\" exists to substitute."
